participant Analyst "Analyst / Agent" actor
participant DOH "DoH Resolver"
participant RDAP "RDAP Server"
participant ThreatDB "Threat Intel API"
msg Analyst -> DOH solid filled #1 "Query A/AAAA/MX/TXT records"
msg DOH -> Analyst dotted filled #2 "Return DNS answers + TTL"
msg Analyst -> RDAP solid filled #3 "Lookup domain registration"
msg RDAP -> Analyst dotted filled #4 "Return registrar & contact info"
msg Analyst -> ThreatDB solid filled #5 "Check reputation / IoC hits"
msg ThreatDB -> Analyst dotted filled #6 "Return pulse / report data"
